    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;I Fell In Love With A Fantasy Farmer&quot; is a point-and-click adventure game and yuri dating sim. The game is set in the Ochre Valley, the agricultural breadbasket of the Kingdom of Falkenhorn. Unfortunately, the farmers and townsfolk of the Ochre Valley are unhappy with many of King Hakon's new taxes and legislations. You play as Lady Althea Redwood, a knight sent by King Hakon to try to ease relations with the citizens living in the Ochre Valley.<br><br>As Althea, you travel around the Ochre Valley, talk to the locals and try to solve their problems to gain favour for the Crown. In this enchanting point-and-click adventure game you must solve puzzles and find hidden items. There is also the opportunity to charm and flirt with some of these beautiful women!<br><br>Featuring:<br><br>- Beautiful Anime Art<br>- Fun and comedic fantasy plot<br>- Folksy and Orchestral Music",
